  - title: LEVEL 24 | Correct Solution & Six Targets
    explanation: 'DESIGN ESTIMATES / NOT LIVE SOLVER READINGS: Supply approximately
      5 V; R1 330 Ohm drop around 2.3 V; D1 around +0.7 V; D2 around -0.7 V signed
      anode-to-cathode voltage; LED around 2.0 V; current about 6.9 mA. Level targets:
      supply 4.8-5.2 V, D1 voltage 0.45-1.0 V, D2 current 0-0.05 mA, green LED ON,
      resistor current 5-8 mA, resistor voltage 2.0-2.6 V. Workstation bindings:
      R_LIMIT_Component / R_LIMIT_Input / R_LIMIT_Output; D_FORWARD_Component / D_FORWARD_Anode
      / D_FORWARD_Cathode; D_REVERSE_Component / D_REVERSE_Anode / D_REVERSE_Cathode.
      Fixed LED binding: led / LED_Anode / LED_Cathode. Verify that evaluator CurrentRange
      accepts zero current for D2. Only SparkLevelEvaluator can award 6/6; drawings
      do not certify wiring.'
    caption: PAGE 4/4 | D1 ON | D2 BLOCKED | GREEN LED ON | 5-8 mA
    parts:
    - id: battery
      kind: 0
      position: {x: 0.09, y: 0.52}
